{"id":"18a4c8ba03fadf06","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-ccc-definition.md","title":"笛卡尔闭范畴","display":"df-cartesian-closed-category — 笛卡尔闭范畴","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-ccc-definition","aliases":["16-df-ccc-definition","Cartesian closed category","16-ccc-definition"],"display":"df-cartesian-closed-category — 笛卡尔闭范畴","depends_on":["[[16-df-finite-limits]]"],"source":"Preliminaries, pp. xiii–xiv (PDF 15–16); §2.3","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-ccc-definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-ccc-definition</span><span>Cartesian closed category</span><span>16-ccc-definition</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cartesian-closed-category — 笛卡尔闭范畴"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Preliminaries, pp. xiii–xiv (PDF 15–16); §2.3"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为范畴；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinProd}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinProd}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75e7c168ac56b22\" href=\"?note=b75e7c168ac56b22\" title=\"16-df-finite-limits\">16-df-finite-limits</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在有限积存在时固定积及其投影，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\times\\operatorname{id}_A\">\\(h\\times\\operatorname{id}_A\\)</span> 为由积泛性质诱导的箭头。末式仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> 成立并选定指数与评价箭头后使用；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X\\times A,B)\">\\(f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X\\times A,B)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda f\">\\(\\Lambda f\\)</span> 简写末式正式构造的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda_{X,A,B}(f)\">\\(\\Lambda_{X,A,B}(f)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{CCC}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cartesian\\text{-}closed\\text{-}category}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal C)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\land\\\\\n&amp;(\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)(\\exists B^A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\n(\\exists\\operatorname{ev}:B^A\\times A\\to B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad(\\forall X)(\\forall f:X\\times A\\to B)(\\exists!h:X\\to B^A)\\\n\\operatorname{ev}\\circ(h\\times\\operatorname{id}_A)=f.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cartesian\\text{-}closed\\text{-}category}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal C)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\land\\\\\n&amp;(\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)(\\exists B^A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\n(\\exists\\operatorname{ev}:B^A\\times A\\to B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad(\\forall X)(\\forall f:X\\times A\\to B)(\\exists!h:X\\to B^A)\\\n\\operatorname{ev}\\circ(h\\times\\operatorname{id}_A)=f.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{\\Lambda_{X,A,B}(f)\\}\\coloneqq\\{h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,B^A)\\mid\\operatorname{ev}\\circ(h\\times\\operatorname{id}_A)=f\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{\\Lambda_{X,A,B}(f)\\}\\coloneqq\\{h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,B^A)\\mid\\operatorname{ev}\\circ(h\\times\\operatorname{id}_A)=f\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>记唯一的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda f\">\\(\\Lambda f\\)</span>。唯一性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}(\\Lambda f\\times\\operatorname{id})=f\">\\(\\operatorname{ev}(\\Lambda f\\times\\operatorname{id})=f\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda(\\operatorname{ev}(h\\times\\operatorname{id}))=h\">\\(\\Lambda(\\operatorname{ev}(h\\times\\operatorname{id}))=h\\)</span>，即 β、η。</li>\n<li>不把有限积的存在式分散到失去量词作用域的多个 display 中。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Preliminaries, pp. xiii–xiv (PDF 15–16); §2.3。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-finite-limits]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-finite-limits","status":"resolved","id":"b75e7c168ac56b22","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为范畴；$\\mathrm{FinProd}$ 采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinProd}","display":false},{"tex":"h\\times\\operatorname{id}_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X\\times A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda f","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda_{X,A,B}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CCC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cartesian\\text{-}closed\\text{-}category}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathcal C)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{FinProd}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\land\\\\\n&(\\forall A,B\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)(\\exists B^A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C)\n(\\exists\\operatorname{ev}:B^A\\times A\\to B)\\\\\n&\\quad(\\forall X)(\\forall f:X\\times A\\to B)(\\exists!h:X\\to B^A)\\\n\\operatorname{ev}\\circ(h\\times\\operatorname{id}_A)=f.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\{\\Lambda_{X,A,B}(f)\\}\\coloneqq\\{h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,B^A)\\mid\\operatorname{ev}\\circ(h\\times\\operatorname{id}_A)=f\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda f","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ev}(\\Lambda f\\times\\operatorname{id})=f","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda(\\operatorname{ev}(h\\times\\operatorname{id}))=h","display":false}],"bytes":1958,"backlinks":[{"id":"3a8714fb34b3e6fd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为范畴，满足 [[16-df-ccc-definition]] 的谓词定义域。"},{"id":"fd0fd104b39e97b1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为范畴，满足 [[16-df-ccc-definition]] 的谓词定义域。"},{"id":"3744a99e6a5c0037","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FinLim}$、$\\mathrm{CCC}$、$\\mathrm{SubObjCl}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-ccc-definition]]、[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]。"},{"id":"fe079ae5e294c97a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化；$u^*:\\mathcal E_J\\to\\mathcal E_I$ 沿 $u:I\\to J$。$\\mathrm{FibFinProd}$、纤维积及其保持性采用 [[16-df-fibred-finite-products]]；$\\mathrm{CCC}$、指数及评价箭头采用 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]。"},{"id":"6ae5978eb27da451","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；一阶结构、CCC、泛对象分别见 [[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-ccc-definition]]、[[16-df-generic-object]]。"},{"id":"928bcf665de24775","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为带提升选择的纤维化。$\\mathrm{PolyFib}$ 采用 [[16-df-polymorphic-fibration]]，$\\mathrm{FibCCC}$ 采用 [[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]，$\\mathrm{CCC}$ 采用 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]。$\\mathrm{Generic}_p(G)$ 采用基本多态纤维化明确引用的泛对象定义。"},{"id":"11ad48f63b554ca7","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为范畴；有限极限、切片及 CCC 分别采用 [[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-slice-category]]、[[16-df-ccc-definition]]。"},{"id":"923cb52a5ddfc2cd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(B,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\mathsf{Ax})$、类型集 $\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)$ 和良型简单类型判断采用 [[16-df-stlc-syntax]]；$\\mathrm{CCC}$ 见 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]。"},{"id":"eeefa02192bbb359","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CCC}$、$\\mathrm{FOFib}$、$\\mathrm{BC}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]、[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]。最后一式的论域为 $p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$；一般 BC 的可逆性不依赖提升选择。"},{"id":"899007f1346b21cf","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(B,C,\\operatorname{ar},\\mathsf{Ax})$、$\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathrm{STT}}(B)$、位置项、代换与两种判断采用 [[16-df-stlc-syntax]]；$\\mathrm{CCC}$ 采用 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]。"},{"id":"e577570f0f20ff68","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为指定终对象 $1_{\\mathcal C}$、二元积与指数的 CCC，见 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]。$N\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C$ 及 $z:1_{\\mathcal C}\\to N,s:N\\to N$ 满足 $\\mathrm{NNO}_{\\mathcal C}(N,z,s)$，见 [[16-df-nno]]。$\\rho:B\\to\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C$。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-ccc-definition|df-cartesian-closed-category — 笛卡尔闭范畴]]"},{"id":"da4a5dccfe412249","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"有限积、子对象分类子和指数分别按 [[16-df-finite-limits]]、[[16-df-subobject-classifier]]、[[16-df-ccc-definition]] 的泛性质理解。"},{"id":"b662179811b5cc72","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 是 [[16-df-ccc-definition]] 的 CCC，固定终对象、积、指数和评价。还假设每对对象具有二元余积，固定余积 $X\\sqcup Y$、内射 $\\iota_1^{X,Y},\\iota_2^{X,Y}$；其泛性质和 $\\mathrm{BinCoprod}$ 在下文展开。"}],"outgoing":["b75e7c168ac56b22"]}